# Technical Design Document — RideX

**Project Name:** RideX – Ride Sharing System  
**Document Version:** 1.0  
**Language Standard:** C++17 (compatible with modern C++ compilers: GCC 9+, Clang 10+, MSVC 2019+)  
**Paradigm:** Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)  

---

## 1. Architecture Overview

RideX is structured using clean Object-Oriented principles. It separates domain entities (Users, Vehicles, Rides, Payments) from service coordination and user interaction (CLI).

```
                        +-------------------+
                        |     main.cpp      |
                        +---------+---------+
                                  |
                                  v
                        +-------------------+
                        |    RideManager    |  (Controller / Service)
                        +---------+---------+
                                  |
         +----------------+-------+---------------+----------------+
         |                        |                                |
         v                        v                                v
+----------------+       +-----------------+             +-------------------+
|  User (Base)   |       | Vehicle (Base)  |             |       Ride        |
+---+--------+---+       +----+----+---+---+             +---------+---------+
    |        |                |    |   |                           |
    v        v                v    v   v                           v
Rider      Driver           Car  Bike  Auto                  +-----------+
              |                                              |  Payment  |
              +--- (has-a) ---+                              +-----------+
```

